#: ../../concepts/fitresults.md:1
msgid "Fitresults"
msgstr ""

#: ../../concepts/fitresults.md:3
msgid ""
"The fitresults objects is a pretty straightforward collection of "
"fitresults."
msgstr ""

#: ../../concepts/fitresults.md:6
msgid ""
"Note that all results are purely based on the fitting and do not include "
"model uncertainties from e.g. the linelist."
msgstr ""

#: ../../concepts/fitresults.md:9
msgid ""
"The given uncertainties in punc are estimated from the residual "
"distribution and seem to be reasonable for some parameters, but get "
"problematic if the parameter only affects a small number of points (e.g. "
"individual abundances)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../concepts/fitresults.md:14
msgid "Here are the fields"
msgstr ""

#: ../../concepts/fitresults.md:16
msgid "`maxiter`: Maximum number of iterations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../concepts/fitresults.md:17
msgid "`chisq`: Final chi square"
msgstr ""

#: ../../concepts/fitresults.md:18
msgid ""
"`uncertainties`: Uncertainties of the fitparameters bases on SME "
"statistics"
msgstr ""

#: ../../concepts/fitresults.md:19
msgid ""
"`fit_uncertainties`: Uncertainties of the fitparameters based solely on "
"the least-squares fit"
msgstr ""

#: ../../concepts/fitresults.md:20
msgid "`covar`: covariance matrix of the fitparameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../concepts/fitresults.md:21
msgid "`grad`: the gradient of the cost function for each parameter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../concepts/fitresults.md:22
msgid "`pder`: The jacobian, i.e. the derivate at each point for each parameter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../concepts/fitresults.md:23
msgid "`resid`: The residual between observation and model"
msgstr ""

#: ../../concepts/fitresults.md:25
msgid "Uncertainties"
msgstr ""

#: ../../concepts/fitresults.md:27
msgid ""
"As mentioned above we estimate the uncertainties using a special metric. "
"This metric is based on the destribution of the derivatives for each "
"fitparameter. We estimate the cumulative distribution function of the "
"**generalized** normal distribution with:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../concepts/fitresults.md:38
msgid ""
"![](https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Normal_Distribution_CDF.svg"
"/500px-Normal_Distribution_CDF.svg.png)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../concepts/fitresults.md:40
msgid ""
"(Example of the cumulative distribution function for various values of "
"sigma)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../concepts/fitresults.md:43
msgid ""
"It is explained in detail in [Paper II (SME: "
"Evolution)](https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2017A%26A...597A..16P/abstract)."
msgstr ""

